# Component reuse

Before creating a component, check `src/registry/components.json` and `src/components/`.

- Reuse an existing widget when the Figma frame is that shape (hero, split + image, FAQ, quotes, gallery, steps, CTA band, cards). Restyle via `brand.ts` tokens and props — do not fork Hero/FAQ/cards per page.
- New unique Figma UI → one new component, then add it to `src/registry/components.json` (`id`, `figmaNames`, `shape`, `component`, `import`). Never paste one-off markup into a page file.
- Do not pick layouts from item counts (band vs grid vs cards). Figma already decided.
- Cards with a link or button: card `flex flex-col h-full`, body `flex-1`, CTA `mt-auto` so links line up regardless of copy length.
